<figure>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 320 610" role="img" aria-labelledby="block-workload-title block-workload-description">
    <title id="block-workload-title">From selected blocks to maintenance totals</title>
    <desc id="block-workload-description">Selected blocks determine membership rows. Membership identifies unique streets to load and calculate maintenance for. It also supplies block IDs and weights to the final summary. The summary combines street maintenance with those weights to return one row per requested block.</desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="block-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="currentColor" />
      </marker>
    </defs>
    <g class="connections" marker-end="url(#block-arrow)">
      <path d="M 108 65 V 125" />
      <path d="M 108 185 V 265" />
      <path d="M 108 325 V 395" />
      <path d="M 108 455 V 535" />
      <path d="M 206 155 H 302 V 565 H 206" />
    </g>
    <g class="nodes">
      <rect x="10" y="15" width="196" height="50" rx="8" />
      <rect x="10" y="125" width="196" height="60" rx="8" />
      <rect x="10" y="265" width="196" height="60" rx="8" />
      <rect x="10" y="395" width="196" height="60" rx="8" />
      <rect class="calculation" x="10" y="535" width="196" height="60" rx="8" />
    </g>
    <g class="labels">
      <text x="108" y="46">Selected blocks</text>
      <text x="108" y="151">Membership rows</text>
      <text class="detail" x="108" y="173">blocks, streets, weights</text>
      <text x="108" y="291">Load unique streets</text>
      <text class="detail" x="108" y="313">geometry and properties</text>
      <text x="108" y="421">Calculate street</text>
      <text x="108" y="443">maintenance</text>
      <text x="108" y="561">Weighted summary</text>
      <text class="detail" x="108" y="583">one row per block</text>
    </g>
    <g class="edge-labels">
      <text x="120" y="101">find membership</text>
      <text x="120" y="219">select</text>
      <text x="120" y="239">street IDs</text>
      <text x="120" y="365">supply streets</text>
      <text x="120" y="490">supply</text>
      <text x="120" y="510">workload</text>
      <text x="220" y="190">supply</text>
      <text x="220" y="210">block IDs</text>
      <text x="220" y="230">and weights</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>Membership is used twice: to find the streets and to divide their results between blocks. The shared street is calculated once, then each block receives its assigned share.</figcaption>
</figure>

